    FIRE monsters. You can only use each of the following effects of "Promethean
    Princess, Bestower of Flames" once per turn. During your Main Phase: You can
    Special Summon 1 FIRE monster from your GY. If a monster(s) is Special Summoned
    to your opponent''s field, while this card is in your GY (except during the Damage
    Step): You can target 1 FIRE monster you control and 1 monster your opponent
    controls; destroy them, and if you do, Special Summon this card.'
